WEBVTT

00:00:00.429 --> 00:00:02.029
In this bookkeeping example,

00:00:02.409 --> 00:00:04.989
two overdue invoices need a decision.

00:00:05.689 --> 00:00:07.390
Start with the weekly overview.

00:00:08.529 --> 00:00:11.369
Open Approvals to read the proposed
reminders

00:00:11.629 --> 00:00:13.509
and the reason behind each one.

00:00:14.289 --> 00:00:15.749
You can approve by email,

00:00:16.209 --> 00:00:17.270
ask for changes,

00:00:17.629 --> 00:00:18.389
or decline.

00:00:19.229 --> 00:00:21.389
Nothing is sent in this fictional demo.
